alibri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t>Lipids Can Provide Pigment</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:cxnSp><p:nvCxnSpPr><p:cNvPr id="163" name="Google Shape;163;p22"/><p:cNvCxnSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvCxnSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="457200" y="838200"/><a:ext cx="8229600" cy="0"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="straightConnector1"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln cap="flat" cmpd="thinThick" w="57150"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2FB0DC"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/><a:miter lim="800000"/><a:headEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/><a:tailEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:cxnSp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr descr="The structures of 2 lipid-based pigments found in bird feathers. To the right, two images of brightly colored birds are shown as examples.&#xA;Shown on top is canthaxanthin (red pigment) (labeled below). Its structure is simple, with 2 6-sided rings containing one double bond by an 18-carbon chain with 9 double bonds (every other bond is double). A total of 4 single carbon bonds are bonded above to 2 carbons on the left and down to 2 carbons on the right end of the chain. Each ring is double bonded to an O; the left ring double bonds up to O at its top carbon; the right ring double bonds down to O at its bottom carbon. To the right is a photograph of a bright red cardinal perched on a branch in a wooded area. Shown below is zeaxanthin (yellow pigment, labeled below). Its structure is very similar to that of canthaxanthin. Its structure is simple, with two 6-sided rings containing one double bond by an 18-carbon chain with 9 double bonds (every other bond is double). A total of 4 single carbon bonds are bonded above to 2 carbons on the left and down to 2 carbons on the right end of the chain. Each ring is bonded to OH; the left ring double bonds down and left to OH; the right ring bonds up &amp; right to OH." id="164" name="Google Shape;164;p22"/><p:cNvPicPr preferRelativeResize="0"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill rotWithShape="1"><a:blip r:embed="rId3"><a:alphaModFix/></a:blip><a:srcRect b="0" l="0" r="0" t="0"/><a:stretch/></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="304800" y="1000125"/><a:ext cx="8534400" cy="4857750"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>